Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":404,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1912672,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":286671,"Name":"Bmitch829","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1460051326,"LastPoster":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1912672,"PostDate":1460051326,"PostContent":"Hello!  Just beginning to plan my destination wedding and don't even know where to start. Here is...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmitch829@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.106.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460049215,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bmitch829","Id":286671,"Name":"Bmitch829","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.106.61","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9306f60a301159b25e0f3f255b3ab9ca","RawContent":"Hello! \n\nJust beginning to plan my destination wedding and don&#039;t even know where to start. Here is what I do know...\n\n\nI want to go somewhere warm and beachy but I don&#039;t want to get married on the beach.\n\nI am looking for an all-inclusive resort but don&#039;t want to break the bank.\n\nI&#039;m traveling from Massachusetts and also have 2 children under 5 but will have my whole family for help.\n\nMy mom is a teacher and I do need to work around a regular school schedule so thinking possibly February vacation for April vacation.\n\nI&#039;m thinking possibly Mexico or the Dominican.\n\nWe have a rather small group that will be attending.\n\n\nThat&#039;s pretty much all I have and I&#039;m open to any suggestions. I feel so confused in this world and want to set things in stone so we can start saving. Help!\n\n\nBecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1912672,"PostDate":1460051326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! <br>\nJust beginning to plan my destination wedding and don't even know where to start. Here is what I do know...<br><br>\nI want to go somewhere warm and beachy but I don't want to get married on the beach.<br>\nI am looking for an all-inclusive resort but don't want to break the bank.<br>\nI'm traveling from Massachusetts and also have 2 children under 5 but will have my whole family for help.<br>\nMy mom is a teacher and I do need to work around a regular school schedule so thinking possibly February vacation for April vacation.<br>\nI'm thinking possibly Mexico or the Dominican.<br>\nWe have a rather small group that will be attending.<br><br>\nThat's pretty much all I have and I'm open to any suggestions. I feel so confused in this world and want to set things in stone so we can start saving. Help!<br><br>\nBecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmitch829@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.106.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460049215,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bmitch829","Id":286671,"Name":"Bmitch829","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac7331a371933ccb0cb5ae8eb45ba17c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Bmitch829\"] Welcome and congrats on your engagement!! The first place to start is the hunt for a great Travel Agent. Do you have one yet? The owners of this site can definitely help you if you are still searching for one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From your list of requirements the resort that I was married at this January might be a good fit. The only thing is the price per person. It is definitely not one of the cheapest resorts but we were able to secure a good rate (Azul Fives). I&#039;m from Canada so our packages work differently. We paid $1630 (CDN) from Toronto that included a flight for 7 days. I would say April is probably a more affordable option in comparison to Feb. If you are working around a teaching schedule you may also want to look at the summer months as prices tend to drop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Azul Fives:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Family Friendly&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Several non beach locations to choose from (Sky Terrace -free, Pier, Beachfront location, Sky Deck for an additional charge)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Sky Terrace (this is where I was married)&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Pier (sorry not a great pic)&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;(New)Beachfront Location&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Sky Deck&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any questions about Azul Fives. The add ons can definitely start to get costly but you can definitely have a budget friendly beautiful wedding at this resort...but then again I&#039;m a bit biased! ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912675,"PostDate":1460053095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286671\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286671-bmitch829\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bmitch829<\/span><\/a> Welcome and congrats on your engagement!! The first place to start is the hunt for a great Travel Agent. Do you have one yet? The owners of this site can definitely help you if you are still searching for one.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From your list of requirements the resort that I was married at this January might be a good fit. The only thing is the price per person. It is definitely not one of the cheapest resorts but we were able to secure a good rate (Azul Fives). I'm from Canada so our packages work differently. We paid $1630 (CDN) from Toronto that included a flight for 7 days. I would say April is probably a more affordable option in comparison to Feb. If you are working around a teaching schedule you may also want to look at the summer months as prices tend to drop.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Azul Fives:<\/p>\n<p>*Family Friendly<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>*Several non beach locations to choose from (Sky Terrace -free, Pier, Beachfront location, Sky Deck for an additional charge)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Sky Terrace (this is where I was married)<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-21888200-1460049139.jpg\" title=\"12801293_10156541706005366_8453295964567052482_n.jpg - Size: 83.92KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-21888200-1460049139.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12801293_10156541706005366_8453295964567052482_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Pier (sorry not a great pic)<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-94496400-1460049237.jpg\" title=\"12592294_10156492773180578_9089099019274090944_n.jpg - Size: 71.34KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-94496400-1460049237.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12592294_10156492773180578_9089099019274090944_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>(New)Beachfront Location<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-79036000-1460049275.jpg\" title=\"Oceanfront location2.jpg - Size: 54.54KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-79036000-1460049275.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Oceanfront location2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Sky Deck<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-65323000-1460049293.jpg\" title=\"floral arrangements1.jpg - Size: 88.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-65323000-1460049293.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"floral arrangements1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any questions about Azul Fives. The add ons can definitely start to get costly but you can definitely have a budget friendly beautiful wedding at this resort...but then again I'm a bit biased! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415551111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.120.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c81a077578dd5bb1d4fe5205e1cc9bb0","RawContent":"I started by googling best destination wedding locations in Jamaica. I found an article that listed about 12 locations with details. I needed a family friendly all inclusive location too. I copied the list and visited each site and was able to find what I feel will be perfect for us!  Good luck and I hope this helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1912676,"PostDate":1460055280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I started by googling best destination wedding locations in Jamaica. I found an article that listed about 12 locations with details. I needed a family friendly all inclusive location too. I copied the list and visited each site and was able to find what I feel will be perfect for us!  Good luck and I hope this helps!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cadesha.benson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.61.107.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453565902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286018.jpg?_r=1459635518","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Endreece","Id":286018,"Name":"Endreece","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.97.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74120ed76f9fdc1ae6b9fe50afe02711","RawContent":"I&#039;m having mine at dreams punta can in the DR. It is kid friendly and they have a few options that aren&#039;t the beach. They have a few different packages you can choose from. \n\n\nSent from my SAMSUNG-SM-G900A using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1912685,"PostDate":1460066448,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm having mine at dreams punta can in the DR. It is kid friendly and they have a few options that aren't the beach. They have a few different packages you can choose from. <br><br>\nSent from my SAMSUNG-SM-G900A using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abyrnes319@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.97.47","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1457931336,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286470.jpg?_r=1457927739","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberguesa","Id":286470,"Name":"amberguesa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.40.47.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f44cd2e88cd3f203c237da82f650979","RawContent":"I am also having mine at Dreams Punta Cana.  I can say the place looks really nice and they are very kid friendly. And your wedding is the only one,on that day and almost everyone has there wedding in Mexico.   And from what I have heard Punta Cana is a really pretty place to visit","Attachments":[],"Id":1912691,"PostDate":1460081591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also having mine at Dreams Punta Cana.  I can say the place looks really nice and they are very kid friendly. And your wedding is the only one,on that day and almost everyone has there wedding in Mexico.   And from what I have heard Punta Cana is a really pretty place to visit \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440298010,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"118.69.78.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2d803162fde2874d24b6cfa77bdccfb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Welcome and congrats on your engagement!! nice to meet you..&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; :wub:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912699,"PostDate":1460105731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Welcome and congrats on your engagement!! nice to meet you..\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/u99bet.info\/keo-nha-cai\/'>ty le ma cao<\/a>","Email":"kelbiiztd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"116.100.184.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442309617,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kelbiiztd","Id":284817,"Name":"kelbiiztd","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.67.210.198","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6acd0fc5758e883069d20022a494046b","RawContent":"Thanks for all the input!","Attachments":[],"Id":1912710,"PostDate":1460139526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                 Thanks for all the input!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmitch829@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.106.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460049215,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bmitch829","Id":286671,"Name":"Bmitch829","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 08 April 2016 - 10:27 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1460140069,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b40ddd11fd3b67375be4d741e5184213","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, Endreece, amberguesa, and Becca, and CONGRATS on your upcoming destination weddings!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re already off to a great start by joining these boards where you&#039;ll find so much helpful info, suggestions, advice + support from everyone :) With all these resources to choose from, your chances of finding your Best match are Awesome!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s to happy research, finding exactly what you need, and creating that Wonderful Wedding Day you envision - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....leaving you with some added inspiration taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;Riviera Maya Wedding Albums&lt;\/a&gt; to ramp up your creativity even more....Enjoy!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_20363532aedb4d548466a914b81972f2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_20363532aedb4d548466a914b81972f2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_20363532aedb4d548466a914b81972f2.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b05aae676b7448458a9aec705513d76e.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b05aae676b7448458a9aec705513d76e.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b05aae676b7448458a9aec705513d76e.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912712,"PostDate":1460139905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, Endreece, amberguesa, and Becca, and CONGRATS on your upcoming destination weddings!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're already off to a great start by joining these boards where you'll find so much helpful info, suggestions, advice + support from everyone <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> With all these resources to choose from, your chances of finding your Best match are Awesome!<\/p>\n<p>Here's to happy research, finding exactly what you need, and creating that Wonderful Wedding Day you envision - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....leaving you with some added inspiration taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Wedding Albums<\/a> to ramp up your creativity even more....Enjoy!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_20363532aedb4d548466a914b81972f2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_20363532aedb4d548466a914b81972f2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_20363532aedb4d548466a914b81972f2.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b05aae676b7448458a9aec705513d76e.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b05aae676b7448458a9aec705513d76e.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b05aae676b7448458a9aec705513d76e.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"838e0ed0c856dd028ab73c98fd2f9aa8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bmitch829\" post=\"1912672\" timestamp=\"1460047726\"]\nHello!\nJust beginning to plan my destination wedding and don&#039;t even know where to start. Here is what I do know...\n\nI want to go somewhere warm and beachy but I don&#039;t want to get married on the beach.\nI am looking for an all-inclusive resort but don&#039;t want to break the bank.\nI&#039;m traveling from Massachusetts and also have 2 children under 5 but will have my whole family for help.\nMy mom is a teacher and I do need to work around a regular school schedule so thinking possibly February vacation for April vacation.\nI&#039;m thinking possibly Mexico or the Dominican.\nWe have a rather small group that will be attending.\n\nThat&#039;s pretty much all I have and I&#039;m open to any suggestions. I feel so confused in this world and want to set things in stone so we can start saving. Help!\n\nBecca[\/quote]@[member=\"Bmitch829\"] , another options is the PAradisus playadelcarmen, because they have this beautiful deck overlooking the ocean. family friendly. check out the wedding. \n\n[url=\"https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2016\/01\/14\/lori-and-rodney-paradisus-resort-riviera-maya-mexico\/\"]https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2016\/01\/14\/lori-and-rodney-paradisus-resort-riviera-maya-mexico\/[\/url]\n\nor the Beach palace cancun.\nThey have a sky deck with amazing views, check out the wedding we did there last year.\n[url=\"https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2015\/11\/14\/mahsa-and-kiarash-beach-palace-cancun-resort-cancun-destination-wedding\/\"]https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2015\/11\/14\/mahsa-and-kiarash-beach-palace-cancun-resort-cancun-destination-wedding\/[\/url]\n\n\nI created this checklist to help you get started\n\n[url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=ZDzTt-e-s8M\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=ZDzTt-e-s8M[\/url]\n\nAlso it all boils down to the  budget and your vision.\n\n\nHappy Planning\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1912733,"PostDate":1460184585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bmitch829, on 07 April 2016 - 09:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello!<br>\nJust beginning to plan my destination wedding and don't even know where to start. Here is what I do know...<br><br>\nI want to go somewhere warm and beachy but I don't want to get married on the beach.<br>\nI am looking for an all-inclusive resort but don't want to break the bank.<br>\nI'm traveling from Massachusetts and also have 2 children under 5 but will have my whole family for help.<br>\nMy mom is a teacher and I do need to work around a regular school schedule so thinking possibly February vacation for April vacation.<br>\nI'm thinking possibly Mexico or the Dominican.<br>\nWe have a rather small group that will be attending.<br><br>\nThat's pretty much all I have and I'm open to any suggestions. I feel so confused in this world and want to set things in stone so we can start saving. Help!<br><br>\nBecca<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286671\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286671-bmitch829\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bmitch829<\/span><\/a> , another options is the PAradisus playadelcarmen, because they have this beautiful deck overlooking the ocean. family friendly. check out the wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2016\/01\/14\/lori-and-rodney-paradisus-resort-riviera-maya-mexico\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/dreamwedding...ra-maya-mexico\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>or the Beach palace cancun.<\/p>\n<p>They have a sky deck with amazing views, check out the wedding we did there last year.<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2015\/11\/14\/mahsa-and-kiarash-beach-palace-cancun-resort-cancun-destination-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/dreamwedding...nation-wedding\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I created this checklist to help you get started<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/ZDzTt-e-s8M?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also it all boils down to the \u00a0budget and your vision.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80031","Title":"Don't Know Where To Begin","LastPostDate":1460184585},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
