> User anapier420 (286736)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.41.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79878,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8195f91da4e00d480fa5d2b4388b7f56","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Moments That Matter\" post=\"1909963\" timestamp=\"1453663837\"]\nCongrats Kim on your first year anniversary!!! and Congrats to KitCat on your upcoming dw and joining our forum community - welcome!!!\nYou&#039;ll find lots of great info here, for your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already :)\nFor some added inspiration, here are a few wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera....enjoy!\n\n....from our [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150951039939487.436910.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3\"]Grand Sirenis Wedding Story Album: [\/url]\n[img]https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xal1\/t31.0-8\/456756_10150951043974487_952250364_o.jpg[\/img]\n\n[img]https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/270816_10150951047479487_48048558_n.jpg?oh=c3d773296092e87bdac228feea8b2736&amp;amp;oe=573C0A5D[\/img]\n\n[img]https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/194911_10150951048114487_1577340724_o.jpg[\/img]\n\nHope you find the info + answers you&#039;re looking for, wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)[\/quote]\nYour photos are always gorgeous!!\n\n@KitCat  Congrats on your engagement and planning a destination wedding!\n\nUnfortunately I completely agree with the other comments. I don&#039;t see how you would get a guest rate of $800 even if you were looking at hotel only. My guess would be closer to $1400 or more but that&#039;s only a guess. I&#039;m in Ontario so don&#039;t know what the rates are from Vancouver to PV. You&#039;ve picked a nice location though. There are some really nice resorts in the area of Puerto Vallarta and Riviera Nayarit. My husband and I have been to PV and really liked it.\n\nI know there was an agent here that the ladies had some success with but I haven&#039;t seen anything recent about her. Have you checked out the vendor reviews at the top to see what past brides are saying about their agents? I know there are also 2 new canadian agents that have joined this site so you could get in touch with Wright Travel and ask them about the canadian agents. You can contact Wright through this site. They own this site and the owner is also a destination wedding bride.\n\nGood luck and happy planning!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909985,"PostDate":1453686283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Moments That Matter, on 24 January 2016 - 12:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congrats Kim on your first year anniversary!!! and Congrats to KitCat on your upcoming dw and joining our forum community - welcome!!!<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of great info here, for your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are a few wedding moments that matter we've captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150951039939487.436910.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Sirenis Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xal1\/t31.0-8\/456756_10150951043974487_952250364_o.jpg\" alt=\"456756_10150951043974487_952250364_o.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/270816_10150951047479487_48048558_n.jpg?oh=c3d773296092e87bdac228feea8b2736&oe=573C0A5D\" alt=\"270816_10150951047479487_48048558_n.jpg?\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/194911_10150951048114487_1577340724_o.jpg\" alt=\"194911_10150951048114487_1577340724_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the info + answers you're looking for, wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your photos are always gorgeous!!<\/p><br \/><p>@KitCat\u00a0 Congrats on your engagement and planning a destination wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Unfortunately I completely agree with the other comments. I don't see how you would get a guest rate of $800 even if you were looking at hotel only. My guess would be closer to $1400 or more but that's only a guess. I'm in Ontario so don't know what the rates are from Vancouver to PV. You've picked a nice location though. There are some really nice resorts in the area of Puerto Vallarta and Riviera Nayarit. My husband and I have been to PV and really liked it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know there was an agent here that the ladies had some success with but I haven't seen anything recent about her. Have you checked out the vendor reviews at the top to see what past brides are saying about their agents? I know there are also 2 new canadian agents that have joined this site so you could get in touch with Wright Travel and ask them about the canadian agents. You can contact Wright through this site. They own this site and the owner is also a destination wedding bride.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.50.165.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79878,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77d28d37c4a1863c78ec163be4e5d777","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KitCat\"] Congratulations and welcome to BDW! &amp;nbsp;My name is Preety Jaswal and I am a travel agent with BDW and based in Vancouver as well. &amp;nbsp;I agree with all the previous posts that a $800 budget is unrealistic for any destination. &amp;nbsp;Feel free to private message me or contact through this form&amp;nbsp;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;so we can go through what it is you are looking for your dream destination wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910300,"PostDate":1454195594,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285961\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285961-kitcat\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KitCat<\/span><\/a> Congratulations and welcome to BDW! \u00a0My name is Preety Jaswal and I am a travel agent with BDW and based in Vancouver as well. \u00a0I agree with all the previous posts that a $800 budget is unrealistic for any destination. \u00a0Feel free to private message me or contact through this form\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span>\u00a0so we can go through what it is you are looking for your dream destination wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>Preety Jaswal - Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' title=\"External link\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' title=\"\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n","Email":"preety@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"69.50.165.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448921039,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285479.jpg?_r=1450836897","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TAPreety","Id":285479,"Name":"TAPreety","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79878,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6c3a575029d9810bf85314fe5fb1610","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;Hi @KitCat&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff11c1;\"&gt;Congratulations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt; on your engagement!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;Las Caletas is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay of &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff6699;\"&gt;Puerto Vallarta &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest. We have plenty spaces for&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;April or May 2017 (including weekends)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Take a look on our wedding packages, designed for 10, 30 till 100 guests, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;Include transportation, ceremony and reception set up, food and open bar&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;: &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81803]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81814]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81807]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82462]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910726,"PostDate":1455144007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:#696969\">Hi @KitCat\u00a0<\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff11c1\">Congratulations<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\"> on your engagement!!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\">Las Caletas is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our private beach cove in the south bay of <\/span><em><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff6699\">Puerto Vallarta <\/span><\/strong><\/em><span  style=\"color:#595959\">and is only accessible by sea, giving it the seclusion and ambiance of an island hideaway. It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, a pyramid amphitheater built into the tropical forest and mountain side, various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest. We have plenty spaces for<\/span><em><span  style=\"color:#696969\">\u00a0<span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">April or May 2017 (including weekends)\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><em><span  style=\"color:#696969\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Take a look on our wedding packages, designed for 10, 30 till 100 guests, we\u00a0<\/span>Include transportation, ceremony and reception set up, food and open bar<span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">: \u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/em><a href='http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81803-beach-wedding-decoration\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_4011181.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Beach wedding decoration'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Beach wedding decoration' id='sml_image_view_81803' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81814-table-setup-idea\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_479229.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Table Setup Idea'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Table Setup Idea' id='sml_image_view_81814' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81807-flower-centerpieces\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_48176.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Flower Centerpieces'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Flower Centerpieces' id='sml_image_view_81807' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82462-awac-108\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18129\/sml_gallery_258213_18129_538316.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='AWAC 108'  width='134' height='200'  alt='AWAC 108' id='sml_image_view_82462' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343062403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}